UI atlas layout (256x256 RGBA; coordinates have top-left origin):
- font.png copied unchanged at (0,0), occupying 256x128 including white texel.
- Item cells 16x16 start at y=128; cell number is unsigned block ID.
  Cell 0 is an original magenta/black fallback; cells 1..46 cover current blocks.
- Hotbar 182x22 at (0,176), selection 24x23 at (0,200), crosshair15x15 at (32,200).
- Dynamic Crosshair sprites 15x15 at x=32,48,64,80,96, y=200;
  default, block, entity, ranged and center dot respectively.
- Original compact numeric glyphs 3x7 at (digit*4,224), digit0..9.

GenerateHudAtlas (test-source, opt-in tool) builds ui.png from existing resources.
